        "id": 1182824
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-03-20T01:53:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ll use CONFIG_FLASH_PHYSICAL to guard this part. Most chips have flash, and they\u0027ll need __flash_dma_start.",
