      "writtenOn": "2020-03-23T08:28:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What I learnt from Dino:\n\nILM is a 4KB static allocated IROM (without cache miss). \n\nchip/it83xx/config_chip.h:\n/* ...\nThe ILM for static code cache, CPU fetch instruction from\nILM(ILM -\u003e CPU)instead of flash(flash -\u003e IMMU -\u003e CPU) if enabled.\n*/",
      "parentUuid": "363c427f_df1e2d16",
